text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818848C {
    "I only register four players for\nPOKéMON CONTESTS.\pIf three other players link up, all\nfour may enter the same CONTEST.\pWould you like to take part?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188521 {
    "Before entering a CONTEST, your\nprogress will be saved."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188559 {
    "We hope you will participate another\ntime."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188584 {
    "Would you like to enter a CONTEST?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081885A7 {
    "When four players are ready, connect\nover a Game Link cable, and register\lwith me, please.\pPlease choose the same CONTEST\nas your fellow contestants.\pThe CONTEST begins as soon as all\nplayers register their entry.\pAfter that, the usual CONTEST rules\napply."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081886DC {
    "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188703 {
    "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818872A {
    "Transmitting..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818873A {
    "Transmission error..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188750 {
    "You may have chosen a different\nCONTEST than another player."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818878D {
    "You may have made a different\nchoice than another player."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081887C7 {
    "Please wait.\nPress the B Button to cancel..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081887F4 {
    "We hope you will participate\nanother time."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818881F {
    "Transmission error.\nPlease try again."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188845 {
    "Your POKéMON will be entered in\nthe CONTEST.\pYour POKéMON is Entry No. {STR_VAR_2}."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081888C6 {
    "The CONTEST will begin shortly."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818890F {
    "Congratulations!\pI did a painting of your POKéMON to\ncommemorate its victory...\pWell, your POKéMON’s appeals were\nso fantastic, it spurred me into\lpainting better than I usually do.\lLook, see?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081889FD {
    "What do you think? I’m confident in\nwhat I’ve done, but do you like it?\pA work of this caliber, it wouldn’t look\nout of place in an art museum.\pHuh? An art museum really is looking\nfor paintings?\pDo you think I should take this there?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188AE8 {
    "What, really? Then, sure, I will take\nthis painting there right now.\pI’ll give it a proper title, too.\pI hope they’ll like it and consider\nexhibiting this.\pPlease check if they did accept this.\nThank you!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188BB5 {
    "Oh, that’s right!\pAs a memento of me painting your\nPOKéMON, please take this."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188C03 {
    "{PLAYER} received a RIBBON."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188C19 {
    "{PLAYER} put the RIBBON on\n{STR_VAR_1}."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188C32 {
    "Okay, see you!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188C41 {
    "Oh... Then, I guess I’ll just take\nthis home with me...\pBut, you know, I would like to take\nthis to the art museum... Okay?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188CBD {
    "Oh, fine, that’s the way it is.\nI will hang this in my own house.\pI’ll just have to try harder next time.\nWell, be seeing you."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188D3C {
    "Hoo, boy... Master Rank CONTESTS,\nhere I come.\pThe world will know that my dearest\nPOKéMON is the cutest being in all\lexistence. The time has come!\lUheheheh."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188DDA {
    "You can see a whole variety of\nPOKéMON here.\pThat’s why I make this place a regular\npart of my daily stroll."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188E47 {
    "Oh, dear! They still haven’t given\nyou a CONTEST PASS?\pYou should go get one in VERDANTURF\nTOWN right away.\pIt’s such a thrill having others see\nPOKéMON that you’ve raised with care\land love."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188F07 {
    "When you get up to the Master Rank\nCONTESTS, you get your eyes opened\lto striking POKéMON that just scream\lto be painted."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188F81 {
    "The TOUGHNESS CONTEST is like\nextreme, man!\pThose muscular appeals...\nCascading sweat... I swoon!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_08188FE3 {
    "Day in and day out, I lavished my care\non this POKéMON.\pIts condition is peaking.\nToday, victory is mine!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_0818904D {
    "I made オカキクケS with Mom, Dad and\nBig Sister. They turned out great!\pI bet you can make smoother, better\nオカキクケS if you have more people."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A10EB {
    "The link was canceled."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A5DFC {
    "Hello, there!\pWe’re accepting registrations for\n{STR_VAR_1} Rank POKéMON CONTESTS."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A5E46 {
    "Would you like to enter your POKéMON\nin our CONTESTS?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A5E7C {
    "Which topic would you like?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A5E98 {
    "A POKéMON CONTEST involves four\nTRAINERS entering one POKéMON each\lin competitive judging.\pA CONTEST has two stages of judging,\nprimary and secondary.\pPrimary judging is a popularity poll\ninvolving the audience.\pSecondary judging features appeals\nby the POKéMON using their moves.\pPlan appeals carefully to earn the\nmost attention of the JUDGE and\lexcite the audience.\lDo your best to stand out.\pThe primary and secondary scores are\nadded at the end.\pThe POKéMON garnering the highest\nscore is declared the winner."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A609B {
    "There are five kinds of CONTESTS.\pCOOL, BEAUTY, CUTE, SMART, and\nTOUGH are the five categories.\pChoose the CONTEST that is right for\nthe POKéMON you plan to enter."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A613F {
    "There are four ranks of POKéMON\nCONTESTS.\pNORMAL, SUPER, HYPER and MASTER\nare the four ranks.\pIn the NORMAL Rank, any POKéMON may\nenter.\pAny POKéMON that won a NORMAL Rank\nCONTEST may move up the SUPER Rank in\lthe same category.\pIn the same way, a SUPER Rank winner\ncan move up to the HYPER Rank, and a\lHYPER Rank winner can advance to the\lMASTER Rank in the same category.\pA POKéMON that won in the MASTER Rank\nmay compete in the MASTER Rank as\loften as its TRAINER wants."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6319 {
    "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6340 {
    "Anyone with a CONTEST PASS may enter.\pYou may obtain a CONTEST PASS at the\nNORMAL RANK CONTEST HALL in\lVERDANTURF TOWN free of charge.\pPlease obtain a CONTEST PASS and\ncome again."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A63F4 {
    "I accept registrations only from four\nlinked players for a POKéMON CONTEST.\pAnyone with a CONTEST PASS may enter.\pYou may obtain a CONTEST PASS at the\nNORMAL RANK CONTEST HALL in\lVERDANTURF TOWN free of charge.\pPlease obtain a CONTEST PASS and\ncome again."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A64F4 {
    "Anyone with a CONTEST PASS may enter.\pIf you don’t have one, I can issue one\nfor you right now.\pWould you like me to issue you a\nCONTEST PASS?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6583 {
    "Here you go!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6590 {
    "Oh?\pWe’ve already issued you a CONTEST\nPASS, {PLAYER}.\pPlease come back with your CONTEST\nPASS."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A65EA {
    "Please visit whenever you would like\nto enter a CONTEST."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6623 {
    "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A664A {
    "I’m terribly sorry, but your POKéMON\nis not qualified to compete at this\lRank yet..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A669F {
    "I’m sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\nin a POKéMON CONTEST."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A66DC {
    "Your POKéMON appears to be in no\ncondition to take part in a CONTEST..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6724 {
    "Oh, but that RIBBON...\pYour POKéMON has won this CONTEST\nbefore, hasn’t it?\pWould you like to enter it in this\nCONTEST anyway?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A67A3 {
    "Is that your CONTEST POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A67C1 {
    "Okay, your POKéMON will be entered\nin this CONTEST.\pYour POKéMON is Entry No. 4.\nThe CONTEST will begin shortly."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6832 {
    "Please come in through here.\nGood luck!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A685A {
    "Congratulations! Your POKéMON is the\nCONTEST winner!\pWe have your prize right here.\nPlease, right this way!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A68C6 {
    "Please come back for your prize\nlater on."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A6F7C {
    "Oh, hello! You were in a POKéMON CONTEST,\nweren’t you?\lIt’s easy to tell from your POKéMON.\pI’m a reporter. I’m working on a story\non POKéMON CONTESTS.\pIf I may, would you be willing to answer\na few questions?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A704E {
    "Oh, you will?\nThank you.\pBriefly, how would you describe the\nCONTEST you just entered?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A70A5 {
    "Ah, I see.\nThat’s a very edifying comment.\pYou get a good feel for what the\nCONTEST was like.\pI’ve got one last question.\pWhen you hear the word “{STR_VAR_2},”\nwhat image do you get?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A7153 {
    "I see!\pSo that’s how you imagine the concept\nof “{STR_VAR_2}” to be.\pThank you!\nYou’ve given me some good ideas.\pI think I can write a good story on\nPOKéMON CONTESTS now.\pMaybe, just maybe, this story will even\nmake it to television.\lI hope you’ll look forward to it!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A7256 {
    "Oh, too bad...\pWell, if you come across a good story,\nplease do share it with me."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081A72A8 {
    "I’ll be looking forward to your next\nPOKéMON CONTEST."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6E63 {
    "Oh? Did you want to make some オカキクケS\nwith this old-timer?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6E9D {
    "Excellent!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6EA8 {
    "Oh...\nYou’ve made this old-timer sad..."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6ED0 {
    "Do you know how to make a オカキクケ?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6EF1 {
    "Let’s get started, then!\pLet’s BERRY BLENDER!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6F1F {
    "Okay, a little explanation, then.\pOh, don’t worry, it’s quite simple.\pWhen the BLENDER’s arrow comes to\nyour marker, just press the A Button.\pThat’s all you have to do.\nYou’ll see how easy it is when you try."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B6FF0 {
    "Oh?\nYou don’t have any BERRIES?\pIf you don’t have any BERRIES,\nyou can’t make any オカキクケS."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B704A {
    "Well, that won’t do at all now, will it?\pIf you don’t mind leftovers, you can\nhave one of my BERRIES.\pThat way, we could make some オカキクケS\ntogether using the BERRY BLENDER."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B70F6 {
    "If I had some BERRIES left over,\nI’d gladly give you one...\pBut, I don’t have any to spare today.\nWe’ll have to do this another time."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B717C {
    "But your オカキクケ CASE is full.\pYou should use some オカキクケS before\nyou come see me again."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B71D2 {
    "But you don’t have a オカキクケ CASE.\pYou should get a オカキクケ CASE and then\ncome see me."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7225 {
    "Let’s get blending already!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7241 {
    "I wonder what kind of オカキクケ I’ll get?\nThis is so exciting!"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B727C {
    "オカキクケS will be made with your friends \nfrom BERRIES in the BERRY BLENDER.\pIs it okay to save the game before\nlinking with your friends?"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7304 {
    "Searching for your friends...\n... ... B Button: Cancel"
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B733B {
    "{STR_VAR_1} arrived."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7347 {
    "{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2} arrived."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B735A {
    "{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2}, and\n{STR_VAR_3} arrived."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7381 {
    "You have no BERRIES.\nThe BERRY BLENDER can’t be used."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B73B7 {
    "Your オカキクケ CASE is full.\nThe BERRY BLENDER can’t be used."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B73F1 {
    "You don’t have a オカキクケ CASE.\nThe BERRY BLENDER can’t be used."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B742F {
    "I love making オカキクケS.\pI always have some BERRIES with me."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7469 {
    "If you’d like, we could make some\nオカキクケS together using the\lBERRY BLENDER."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B74B4 {
    "Oh?\nYou don’t have any BERRIES?\pWell, that won’t do at all now, will it?\pIf you don’t mind leftovers, you can\nhave one of my BERRIES."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B753A {
    "We’ll use it to make オカキクケS together\nusing the BERRY BLENDER."
}

text Naranja_IslaKumquat_G13_M04_Text_081B7578 {
    "Oh?\nYou don’t have any BERRIES?\pIf I had some left over, I’d gladly\ngive you one...\pBut, I don’t have any to spare today.\nSorry about that."
}
